{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Marrow Health 是一款把 Apple Health 各項指標集中管理的健康數據工具，適合想完整掌握身體狀況、睡眠質素與訓練成果的 iPhone 用戶。應用免費、無需註冊帳號，原價 US $80，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>健康數據一站式管理</h2>\n<p>Marrow Health 可讀取 172 種 Apple Health 數據類型，涵蓋步數、心率、心率變異、睡眠階段、血氧與身體組成，加上內建餐飲日記及力量訓練記錄，合共追蹤 178 組數據，並提供每日、每週與每月趨勢。記錄飲食時可拍照估算營養、掃描條碼，或離線搜尋內建食物資料庫，每餐追蹤 39 種營養素。所有數據可匯出為 CSV、JSON 或 GPX。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-179-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-180-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-181-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-182-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-183-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-184-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Marrow Health</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-11T14:39:42.366844+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":356,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}